Z||000007||Philphine||09-19-2001||08:32 AM||||i've been saying i'm going to try it but haven't yet. if you do the 6000 swap for the rear you can find about any type of wide wheel you want (i'm assuming you just want 10" wide on the rear). i'm not sure how much back space i'll have (done some measuring but it's so close i can't call it), but i've got 3 pairs of 10" wide wheels that will fit bolt patternwise if i make the swap.||||reg||1
